<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it downgraded Tellabs Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Late on Monday, Tellabs posted a second quarter profit of $0.32 a share compared with a loss of $0.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- Tellabs gained 2/16 to 61-13/16.</p>
</text>
